d attacks</strong> and <strong>much more...!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997660/extras/cb4982e1b17cd529b7b44f3bdfd04790.poster.avif?t=1782150992\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997660/extras/cb4982e1b17cd529b7b44f3bdfd04790.webm?t=1782150992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abilities</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful skills that reward <strong>timing and precision</strong>. Abilities are provided by specialized <strong>buildings</strong> that can be <strong>captured and upgraded.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997660/extras/1cc55f4c65c5e5ce39d312c15fa70f02.poster.avif?t=1782150992\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997660/extras/1cc55f4c65c5e5ce39d312c15fa70f02.webm?t=1782150992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Changing weather</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, <strong>vision is much shorter</strong> which makes sneaking actions dangerous.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local<strong> dynamic weather effects</strong> change the battlefield:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain - slows down units by mudding the roads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense fog - hides units from vision.</p></l